{
  "name": "Trellis Video Ad Frame v1",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Trellis Video Ad \u2014 FRAME (v1)\n\nGenerates the approved-before-render first frame.\n\n**In:** POST /webhook/trellis-video-ad-frame\n```\n{ job_id, branch, product_description,\n  target_segment, tone, cta, setting,\n  actor_style, actor_gender,\n  video_duration, aspect_ratio,\n  pipeline, platform,\n  regenerate?: bool }\n```\n**Out:** job row -> status `awaiting_approval`, `frame_url` set.\n\nRender is a SEPARATE workflow, fired by the Approve button.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-81078",
      "name": "Sticky Note 717",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -620,
        -300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Why a frame first\nText-to-video invents the scene: the subject fades in, the background drifts, the model burns seconds on dead air.\n\nGenerating an approved still and animating THAT removes the model's freedom to improvise.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "sticky-71235",
      "name": "Sticky Note 63",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -620,
        200
      ]
    },
